  "title": "Linde Increases Dividend 7%",
  "summary": "Woking, UK, February 24, 2026 – Linde plc (Nasdaq: LIN) today announced its Board of Directors has declared a 7% increase in the company's quarterly dividend to $1.60 per share. This marks the 33rd consecutive year of quarterly dividend increases on the company’s common stock. <br /> <br /> The dividend is payable on March 26, 2026, to shareholders of record on March 11, 2026.",
